<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"8269d7b1-796b-4ed8-86cc-2b7df39b7ad0">
  <p><strong>Given (Bi=E1=BA=BFt r=E1=BA=B1ng):</strong> H=E1=BB=87 th=E1=
