t ng=C6=B0=E1=BB=A1ng [Gi=C3=A1 tr=E1=BB=8B cho ph=C3=A9p])"</em>.</p></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"0fefe6c3-3c0b-4bfd-89c4-244ff6180cbb"><em>EN: "Ticket=
 [Ticket ID] requires approval due to [Variance Type] variance: [Actual Val=
ue] (Exceeds threshold of [Allowed Value])"</em></li>
